<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the National Trust Fund (Incorporated) shall bear a device as the Board may approve and the common seal may from time to time be broken, changed, altered and made anew as the Board thinks fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
