<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "At any meeting of the Board, three members shall form a quorum and the Chairperson shall preside at all meetings of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
