<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), in the absence of the Chairperson at any meeting of the Board, a member elected by the members present shall preside over the meeting, and may exercise the powers of the Chairperson."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
