<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_19__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Board or a committee who directly or indirectly has by himself, his spouse or children any interest in any matter under discussion by the Board or committee shall, as soon as practicable after the fact has come to that member’s knowledge, disclose to the Board or committee the fact and nature of his interest."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
