<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_19__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
