<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_21__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The officers and servants of the National Trust Fund (Incorporated) shall hold office for such period, receive such remuneration and shall be subject to such regulations on conduct and discipline and other terms and conditions of service as may be determined by the Board. Public servant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
