<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "Every member of the Board, member of a committee, officer and servant of the National Trust Fund (Incorporated), who is not a member of the public service, while discharging his duties under this Act shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Application of Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II__cl_23> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
