<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the National Trust Fund and the National Trust Fund Panel established under the repealed Act shall cease to exist. Continuance of laws, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
