<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to this Act, Bank Negara Malaysia shall, on the date of the coming into operation of this Act, continue to discharge its duties and responsibilities under the repealed Act for such period as may be determined by the Minister, on the recommendation of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
