<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_V__cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Act, the financial year of the Fund shall commence on 1 January and end on 31 December of each year. Statutory Bodies (Accounts and Annual Reports) Act 1980"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_V__cl_32> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/22/eng@> .
